---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { profile } from "../../data/profile";
import { externalCase } from "../../data/work";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Work | Eero Siivola"
  description="How Eero Siivola approaches data and AI work, with a public industry example and the experience behind it."
>
  <header class="work-story-hero section-dark">
    <div class="shell work-story-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Work</p>
        <h1>I take responsibility for difficult data and AI work.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="work-story-intro">
        My role is often to hold the whole problem together: the decision, the evidence, the model,
        the software, the delivery plan, and the people who will use the result.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section work-story">
    <div class="shell work-story-grid">
      <p class="kicker">What I bring</p>
      <div class="work-story-body">
        <h2>
          The same problem can require statistical judgement, software architecture, process
          design, and leadership.
        </h2>
        <p class="work-story-lead">
          I am comfortable moving between them. More than ten years in machine learning has taken
          me through research, consulting, public-sector systems, team management, and current
          industry delivery.
        </p>
        <p>
          I have led projects from planning to delivery for more than five years and managed a
          ten-person multidisciplinary team for three. My doctorate provides the theoretical depth.
          Delivery depends on choosing what matters and getting it into use.
        </p>
        <div class="work-story-links">
          <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Experience and roles</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/research/">Research and open source</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section work-case-story">
    <div class="shell work-case-grid">
      <p class="kicker">Public case · Vuono Group</p>
      <article>
        <h2>{externalCase.title}</h2>
        <p>{externalCase.summary}</p>
        <p>
          The project combined measured and synthetic data, repeatable benchmarking, and modular
          signal-processing software prepared for embedded development.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href={externalCase.href}>
          Read the public case at Vuono Group
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-story-contact">
    <div class="shell work-story-contact-inner">
      <p>I currently work as a Senior Data Scientist at Vuono Group.</p>
      <a class="button button-accent" href={profile.social.linkedin}>Contact on LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
